{"title":"Parsnip","sourceTitle":"Parsnip/pt-br","html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"pt-BR\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"mw-pt-languages noprint navigation-not-searchable\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"mw-pt-languages-label\">Other languages:</div><ul class=\"mw-pt-languages-list\"><li><a href=\"/Parsnip\" class=\"mw-pt-languages-ui mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--complete\" title=\"Parsnip (100% translated)\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">English</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Parsnip/es\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--low\" title=\"Chirivías (3% translated)\" lang=\"es\" dir=\"ltr\">español</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Parsnip/fr\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--high\" title=\"Panais (97% translated)\" lang=\"fr\" dir=\"ltr\">français</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"mw-pt-languages-selected mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--complete\" lang=\"pt-BR\" dir=\"ltr\">português do Brasil</span></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Parsnip/ru\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--low\" title=\"Пастернак (3% translated)\" lang=\"ru\" dir=\"ltr\">русский</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Parsnip/zh\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--complete\" title=\"欧防风 (100% translated)\" lang=\"zh\" dir=\"ltr\">中文</a></li></ul></div>\n<div class=\"center\" style=\"background-color: #eee; border-style: solid; border-width: 1px 1px 1px 4px; border-color: #88acf5; border-radius: 4px; font-size: 85%; width: 90%; padding: 0.2em; margin: 0.5em auto; margin-left:0px;\"><div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: flex-start; align-items: center; padding-left: 10px\">\n<div style=\"margin-left: 10px; text-align: left;\">\n<p>Esta página foi verificada pela última vez para a versão do Vintage Story <b>1.18.6</b>.\n</p>\n</div></div></div>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"position:relative; border-radius:7px; font-size:90%; width:300px; float:right; margin-left:5px; margin-bottom: 5px;\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#000000\" colspan=\"2\" style=\"border-top-right-radius:7px; border-top-left-radius:7px; text-align:center; font-size:13.5px;\"><font color=\"white\"><b>Chirívia</b></font>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#d3ab92\" colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Vegetable-parsnip.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/e/e4/Vegetable-parsnip.png/100px-Vegetable-parsnip.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/e/e4/Vegetable-parsnip.png/150px-Vegetable-parsnip.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/e/e4/Vegetable-parsnip.png/200px-Vegetable-parsnip.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Empilhável</b>\n</td>\n<td>64\n</td></tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#000000\" colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center; font-size:13.5px;\"><font color=\"white\"><b>Comida</b></font>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Saciedade</b>\n</td>\n<td>100\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Categoria</b>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p>Legume\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#000000\" colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center; font-size:13.5px;\"><font color=\"white\"><b>Transitável</b></font>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Tempo fresco</b>\n</td>\n<td>21 dias\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b><a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Rot#Notes\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Rot\">Tempo de apodrecimento</a></b>\n</td>\n<td>4 dias\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b><a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Rot#Notes\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Rot\">Taxa de apodrecimento</a></b>\n</td>\n<td>0.5\n</td></tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#000000\" colspan=\"2\" class=\"Bloba\" style=\"text-align:center; font-size:13.5px; border-bottom-right-radius:7px; border-bottom-left-radius:7px;\"><a href=\"/Items\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Items\"><font color=\"white\"><b>Itens</b></font></a>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><br />\n<b>Pastinaga</b> são uma fonte de vegetais <a href=\"/Satiety\" title=\"Satiety\">nutrição</a>. Quando atrofiadas, as culturas de pastinaga produzem mais do que a maioria das outras culturas atrofiadas.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Obtendo\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Obtendo</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Cultivo\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Cultivo</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Uso\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Uso</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Histórico\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Histórico</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Observações\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Observações</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Galeria\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Galeria</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Veja_também\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Veja também</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Referências\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Referências</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<p><span id=\"Obtaining\"></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Obtendo\">Obtendo</span></h2>\n<p>Pequenos trechos de plantações de pastinaga podem ser encontrados durante a exploração, em áreas com os seguintes <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Temperature#Effect_on_plants\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Temperature\">temperatura</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Temperature#Effect_on_plants\" title=\"Temperature\"> </a></span>, <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Weather#Precipitation\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Weather\">precipitação</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Weather#Precipitation\" title=\"Weather\"> </a></span> e <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/World_generation#Tree_Generation\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/World generation\">florestamento</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/World_generation#Tree_Generation\" title=\"World generation\"> </a></span>.\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Parâmetro</th>\n<th>Min. valor</th>\n<th>Máx. valor\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Temperature\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Temperature\">Temperatura</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Temperature\" title=\"Temperature\"> </a></span></td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>22\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Weather\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Weather\">Chuva</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Weather\" title=\"Weather\"> </a></span></td>\n<td>0.38</td>\n<td>0.75\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Floresta</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>0.65\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Os pedaços que satisfazem estas condições têm uma probabilidade de 1,5% de gerar 0-10 culturas de pastinaga, o que pode incluir uma mistura de culturas maduras e imaturas.\n</p><p>Ruínas superficiais e subterrâneas geralmente contêm 1 ou mais <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Cracked_vessel\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Cracked vessel\">vasos de saque rachados</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Cracked_vessel\" title=\"Cracked vessel\"> </a></span>, que podem conter sementes de colheita. Mas nenhum contém sementes de pastinaga.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</p><p>Pastinaga e sementes de pastinaga podem ser adquiridas em <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Trading#Agriculture\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Trading\">comerciantes agrícolas</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Trading#Agriculture\" title=\"Trading\"> </a></span>.\n</p><p><span id=\"Cultivation\"></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Cultivo\">Cultivo</span></h2>\n<figure typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"><a href=\"/File:Parsnip-fully-grown-crop.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/8/88/Parsnip-fully-grown-crop.png/200px-Parsnip-fully-grown-crop.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"200\" height=\"161\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/8/88/Parsnip-fully-grown-crop.png/300px-Parsnip-fully-grown-crop.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/8/88/Parsnip-fully-grown-crop.png/400px-Parsnip-fully-grown-crop.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"422\" data-file-height=\"339\" /></a><figcaption>Chirívias maduras</figcaption></figure>\n<p>As culturas de pastinaga toleram temperaturas de -10 a 32°C, mas só crescem acima de 0°C. Se a temperatura descer abaixo de -10°C ou exceder 32°C, a cultura da pastinaga tornar-se-á <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Temperature#Effect_on_plants\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Temperature\">\"atrofiado\"</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Temperature#Effect_on_plants\" title=\"Temperature\"> </a></span> e começará a acumular danos. As colheitas atrofiadas de pastinaga renderão 75% do normal quando colhidas. Se acumularem danos suficientes para morrerem devido ao frio ou calor excessivo, as culturas de pastinaga produzirão 75% do normal quando colhidas.\n</p><p>As culturas de pastinaga consomem 20 <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Farming#Soil_nutrients\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Farming\">P (fósforo)</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Farming#Soil_nutrients\" title=\"Farming\"> </a></span> em 8 estágios de crescimento. Durante os estágios 2 a 7, as culturas de pastinaga alimentam <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Bees\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Bees\">abelhas</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Bees\" title=\"Bees\"> </a></span> e <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Butterfly\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Butterfly\">borboletas</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Butterfly\" title=\"Butterfly\"> </a></span>. As culturas de pastinaga levam <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Farming#Time\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Farming\">2 meses</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Farming#Time\" title=\"Farming\"> </a></span> a amadurecer, assumindo uma taxa de crescimento próxima de 100%. Baixo <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Farming#Moisture\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Farming\">umidade</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Farming#Moisture\" title=\"Farming\"> </a></span> ou <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Farming#Soil_nutrients\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Farming\">níveis de nutrientes</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Farming#Soil_nutrients\" title=\"Farming\"> </a></span> pode atrasar significativamente a maturação.\n</p><p>Cada bloco de culturas maduras de pastinaga produzirá 10-14 pastinacas e 1-2 pacotes de sementes. A colheita no estágio 7 renderá de 3 a 5 pastinacas, com 99% de chance de obter 1 pacote de sementes. A colheita antes do estágio 7 tem 0% de chance de obter pastinaga e 70% de chance de obter 1 pacote de sementes.\n</p><p><span id=\"Usage\"></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Uso\">Uso</span></h2>\n<p>Pastinagas cruas concedem 100 vegetais <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/satiety\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/satiety\">saciedade</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Satiety\" title=\"Satiety\"> </a></span> quando consumidas. A pastinaga é qualificada como vegetal para receitas <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/cooking\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/cooking\">cozimento</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Cooking\" title=\"Cooking\"> </a></span>, inclusive em ensopado de carne, ensopado de legumes, sopas e mingaus. A pastinaga, como vegetal, beneficia do armazenamento em recipientes de cerâmica ou em <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Room#Cellar\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Room\">caves</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Room#Cellar\" title=\"Room\"> </a></span>. Eles podem ser preservados posteriormente através de <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Food_preservation#Pickling\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Food preservation\">decapagem</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Food_preservation#Pickling\" title=\"Food preservation\"> </a></span>.\n</p><p>As pastinacas podem ser colocadas em um <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/trough\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/trough\">calha</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Trough\" title=\"Trough\"> </a></span> grande, mas nem os porcos nem as ovelhas as comerão, pois são adequadas apenas para o Panda <a href=\"/Bear\" title=\"Bear\">Urso</a>. Quando colocados em um pequeno <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/trough\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/trough\">calha</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Trough\" title=\"Trough\"> </a></span>, as lebres os comerão. <sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</p><p><span id=\"History\"></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Hist.C3.B3rico\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Histórico\">Histórico</span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th valign=\"middle\" style=\"background-color: #5E462A; color: #EAD3B3; border: 2px solid; border-color: #382b1e; text-align: center;\">Versão\n</th>\n<th valign=\"middle\" style=\"background-color: #5E462A; color: #EAD3B3; border: 2px solid; border-color: #382b1e; text-align: center;\">Descrição\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th valign=\"middle\" style=\"background-color: #D1B296; text-align: center;\">v1.16.0\n</th>\n<td valign=\"middle\" style=\"background-color: #CCBCAB; border-color: transparent;\">dobrou o tempo de crescimento e a produtividade para a maioria das culturas, com algumas exceções.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-3\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><span id=\"Notes\"></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Observa.C3.A7.C3.B5es\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Observações\">Observações</span></h2>\n<ul><li>Jan-Jun, se a temperatura for de 0-14°C às 16h, é bom para plantar sementes de pastinaga.</li>\n<li>Pastinaga é uma boa cultura para se concentrar em um <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Health#Increasing_maximum_health\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Health\">dieta balanceada</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Health#Increasing_maximum_health\" title=\"Health\"> </a></span>. Eles usam um nutriente diferente do linho e da maioria dos grãos, têm maior tolerância ao frio do que a maioria das culturas e têm maior rendimento quando atrofiados do que a maioria das culturas. Além disso, você pode replantar <i>sem</i> rotação de culturas, já que <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/fertilizer\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/fertilizer\">farinha de osso</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Fertilizer\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Fertilizer\"> </a></span> é fácil de obter em grande quantidade.</li></ul>\n<p><span id=\"Gallery\"></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Galeria\">Galeria</span></h2>\n<p><span id=\"See&#95;also\"></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Veja_tamb.C3.A9m\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Veja_também\">Veja também</span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Farming\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Farming\">Agricultura</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Farming\" title=\"Farming\"> </a></span>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Fertilizer\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Fertilizer\">Fertilizante</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Fertilizer\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Fertilizer\"> </a></span></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Meal\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Meal\">Refeição</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Meal\" title=\"Meal\"> </a></span></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Food_preservation#Pickling\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Food preservation\">Decapagem</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Food_preservation#Pickling\" title=\"Food preservation\"> </a></span></li></ul>\n<p><span id=\"References\"></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Refer.C3.AAncias\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Referências\">Referências</span></h2>\n<div class=\"mw-references-wrap\"><ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-1\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-1\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">See <code>vssurvivalmod-master\\Block\\BlockLootVessel.cs</code></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-2\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-2\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">See <code>assets\\survival\\blocktypes\\wood\\trough-large.json</code>, line 124</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-3\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-3\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.vintagestory.at/blog.html/news/homesteading-part-2-combat-update-stable-1160-r310/\">devlog</a></span>\n</li>\n</ol></div>\n<p><br style=\"clear:both\" />\n</p>\n<div style=\"margin: auto; padding: 4px; border-color: #382b1e; border-width: 3px; border-style: solid; margin: auto; width: 90%; border-radius: 4px; background-color: #e0cfbb;\">\n<table class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" style=\"border-spacing: 2px; width: 100%;\">\n  <tbody><tr><th colspan=\"2\" style=\"background: rgb(91,76,62); background: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(91,76,62,1) 0px, rgba(91,76,62,0) 5px, rgba(56,43,30,0) calc(100% - 5px), rgba(56,43,30,1) 100%), linear-gradient(to right, rgba(91,76,62,1) 0px, rgba(69,52,36,1) 5px, rgba(69,52,36,1) 50%, rgba(69,52,36,1) calc(100% - 5px), r